&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an Enterprise Account Executive to serve as a founding member of our go-to-market expansion into Southeast Asia, based in Singapore. You will drive adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with the region&#39;s leading digital-native companies—from high-growth startups to established unicorns and super-apps—across Singapore, Indonesia, Vietnam, Thailand, Malaysia, and the Philippines. Owning the full sales cycle from first outbound to launch, you&#39;ll act as a trusted partner to customers as they embed Claude into their products and operations. As a first mover in ASEAN, you&#39;ll shape our regional strategy from the ground up, building the playbooks and market insight that will scale as our team grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic across ASEAN, owning the full sales cycle from prospecting through deployment with digital-native customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute sales strategies tailored to the region&#39;s distinct markets, accounting for differences in market maturity, regulatory environment, language, and buying behaviour across Southeast Asian countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead market expansion by identifying high-potential customer segments and use cases within the region&#39;s startup and scale-up ecosystem, including fintech, e-commerce, super-apps, gaming, SaaS, and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish foundational go-to-market practices as a first mover in ASEAN, creating playbooks, templates, and frameworks that scale with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform product roadmaps by gathering customer feedback and conveying market needs specific to Southeast Asian enterprises, including multilingual and localisation requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners in product, marketing, solutions, and partnerships—including regional cloud and channel partners—to differentiate our offerings and sustain a competitive edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a market expert on ASEAN&#39;s digital-native landscape, providing strategic insight to global leadership on regional trends, competitive dynamics, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of enterprise sales experience driving adoption of emerging technologies with digital-native businesses in Southeast Asia, with a consultative, solutions-oriented approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the ASEAN startup and scale-up ecosystem, including familiarity with leading digital-native companies across multiple markets in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and closing strategic deals by translating multifaceted technical requirements into tailored solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets in fast-paced organisations while managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex, customised commercial agreements in Southeast Asian market contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to build relationships from ICs to C-level executives and cultural fluency across ASEAN business environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset and comfort with ambiguity as a founding team member building processes and strategy from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a related field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling AI/ML, developer platforms, cloud, or API-based products to technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with founders, CTOs, and product leaders at prominent Southeast Asian technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with hyperscaler or channel partners to co-sell into regional accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in a Southeast Asian language in addition to English (e.g. Bahasa Indonesia, Vietnamese, Thai)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing a new market or region for a high-growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems, and a strong interest in ensuring frontier AI is developed safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
